# kali-mini - IP Tracker CelcomDigi Edition
Tool ringan auto-detect IP, tested 100% WORK di Long Lama, Sarawak.

## Features
- Support IPv4 (182.x) & IPv6 (2402::)
- Fix JSON error ipapi.co
- Google Maps link auto

## Cara guna
chmod +x kali.sh
./kali.sh

